  nameColor: {r: 0.45, g: 0.5, b: 0.55, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Ah. A new face. Kenji Tanaka. Sit, if you have time. Stand, if you do not.
  - A farmer plants for people he will never meet. That is a good way to spend a life.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Walt thinks three moves ahead. I think about lunch. Somehow I keep winning.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The slow river reaches the sea too. My daughter says this is not an excuse to be late.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Every morning I greet the same crow on the football field. He has not greeted me back. Yet.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rain washes the board clean. Tomorrow we set the pieces again.
  - label: Winter
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 8
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - In winter the tea is hotter and the chess is slower. Both are improvements.
