  - {fileID: 412067699, guid: 3ff7b37ed0fc2384980ae407177533bc, type: 3}
  portraitIdle: {fileID: 1125398735, guid: 78c1e0197a5cdbf4d88aae9b6fc3d871, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 737256883, guid: 78c1e0197a5cdbf4d88aae9b6fc3d871, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: -13269053, guid: 78c1e0197a5cdbf4d88aae9b6fc3d871, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -967651149, guid: 78c1e0197a5cdbf4d88aae9b6fc3d871, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.65, g: 0.3, b: 0.25, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Gus Petrakis. Forty years a builder. I put the roof on Frank's store, and I've been keeping an eye on it since.
  - You need anything built, don't ask me, I'm retired. Ask me how I WOULD have built it. That's free.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Frank's prices are robbery. I tell him every morning. Then I buy a box of nails so he doesn't feel bad.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Walt Delgado puts his fence posts in crooked. I go down there most afternoons to say so. It's exercise.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - That boy with the guitar plays the same four songs. I've nearly learned the words. Don't tell him.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rain. Good. We'll find out whose roof I did and whose roof somebody else did.
  - label: Sunday
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 64
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Sundays Frank shuts the store and we watch the football in the park. He brings sandwiches. They're terrible.
  shop: {fileID: 0}
  hardware: {fileID: 0}
  shopSpotId: StoreCheckout
  shopSpotRadius: 3
  nowDoing: 
