  nameColor: {r: 0.25, g: 0.4, b: 0.65, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Morning! Emeka Abara. I carry the mail, so I already know your name, your address and that nobody writes to you yet.
  - We'll fix that. Everybody gets a postcard from me in their first week.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - 'Eleven doorsteps every morning, rain or shine. Best job in the suburb: I get the news before the newspaper does.'
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - If you ever see my Nia chasing beetles on the football field, send her home for dinner, would you?
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Frank orders so many catalogues I should charge him by the kilo.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Wet letters, wet socks. The mail still goes out. That's the deal.
  - label: Sunday
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 64
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
