  portraitIdle: {fileID: -2109702891, guid: f80daf854f86c3f449481c189aba9971, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 204865625, guid: f80daf854f86c3f449481c189aba9971, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: -639197717, guid: f80daf854f86c3f449481c189aba9971, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -811808220, guid: f80daf854f86c3f449481c189aba9971, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.35, g: 0.4, b: 0.5, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Hey, good to meet you! Marcus Bell. I work in the city. At... the big tower. Yes, that tower.
  - Don't tell Frank. Or the Kims. I buy everything from them, I promise. It's a guilt thing.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The tower sells everything Frank sells, cheaper, and nobody there knows what any of it is for.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I jog round the football field every morning. Kenji and his crow are always there first.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Lena draws me when I'm not looking. I look tired in all of them.
  - label: Work days
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 31
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Off to the tower. Forty floors, and my desk doesn't have a window. The farm must be nice.
  - label: Weekend
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 96
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Weekend! I'm fixing the porch. Frank sold me the paint and a lecture, both good.
