  nameColor: {r: 0.3, g: 0.6, b: 0.7, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Oh, hold still... no, sorry, go on. I'm Lena. I illustrate children's books, so I draw everything. Including you, just now.
  - You have a very good hat face. Do you own a hat?
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
