      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Nia poses for me if I pay her in beetle facts. I mean, if I LISTEN to beetle facts.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The light in the plaza around four o'clock is perfect. Don't tell the other illustrators. There aren't any, but still.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
