      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Kenji has beaten me at chess nine days running. I'm lulling him. It's a strategy.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Frank sells a fine hammer and talks a load of nonsense. I go for the hammers.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rosa says I'm grumpy. I'm not grumpy. I'm accurate.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My knee said rain two days ago. The knee is never wrong.
  - label: Hardware days
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 42
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Going up to Frank's later. He's got the wrong screws in the wrong bin again. Somebody has to tell him.
