      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Soo-ah at the general store sorts her seed rack by season. It is the most beautiful thing in this town.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My roommate Tariq practises guitar at midnight. I've started thinking of it as a very slow lullaby.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Did you know a sunflower is actually thousands of tiny flowers? I think about that a lot.
  - label: University days
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 21
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Lab day. If I come home smelling of compost, it went well.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
